        {
            "id": "be5cf4f8-2f10-4dc0-bd37-cf24605a85dd",
            "name": "Main Overview",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
            "position": [
                -432,
                112
            ],
            "parameters": {
                "width": 464,
                "height": 552,
                "content": "## Workflow Monitoring Endpoint \n\n\n### How it works\nThis workflow monitors your n8n instance health through API endpoints. Send POST requests with different actions to get execution metrics, workflow statuses, and failure analysis. Generates comprehensive KPIs including success rates, timing metrics, and identifies problematic workflows.\n\n### Setup steps  \n1. Replace `<YOUR_N8N_INSTANCE>` in all HTTP nodes with your instance URL\n2. Configure n8n API credentials for authentication  \n3. Test webhook with action parameters:\n   - `get_active_workflows`\n   - `get_workflow_executions` \n   - `get_execution_details`\n4. Set `limit` and `workflow_id` in request body as needed\n\n### Customization\nModify Processing Audit node to adjust failure thresholds (currently 10% triggers alerts) or add custom KPIs for your monitoring needs."
            },
            "typeVersion": 1
        },
